---
layout: layouts/landing.njk
title: Service areas
description: Eureka serves trades businesses across the western United States. We have local market knowledge in Boise, Spokane, Portland, and Salt Lake City.
permalink: /service-areas/
hasContactForm: true
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Service areas</p>
    <h1 class="page-hero__title">Local market knowledge, wherever you book jobs.</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__sub">We’re headquartered in Boise, but we serve trades businesses across the western United States. Each market has its own search behavior, seasonality, and competitive landscape — and we build campaigns that reflect that.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Markets</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Where we work today.</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">Don’t see your city? We probably still serve it — get in touch.</p>

    <div class="services__grid services__grid--expanded">
      {% for area in serviceAreas %}
        <a class="service-card" href="/service-areas/{{ area.slug }}/">
          <div class="service-card__index">{{ area.state }}</div>
          <h3 class="service-card__title">{{ area.city }}</h3>
          <p class="service-card__body">{{ area.tagline }}</p>
          <span class="service-card__cta">Learn more <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta-block.njk" %}
